### 3. View / collapse configuration

> “Select up to 3 dimensions to project into the visual viewport.”  

```sql
CREATE TABLE view_manifolds (
    id                  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    node_id             TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES ten_d_nodes(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,

    active_axes         TEXT[] NOT NULL
        CHECK (cardinality(active_axes) BETWEEN 1 AND 3)
        CHECK (active_axes <@ ARRAY['x','y','z','w','v','u','q','p','s','f']),
    projection_target_dims INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 3
        CHECK (projection_target_dims IN (2,3)),

    proc_ref            TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PROC-044'
);
```

You can keep **one active view per node**:

```sql
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX view_manifold_unique ON view_manifolds (node_id);
```

