### 4. DecaMatrix storage (11×11)

> “11x11 Identity Matrix (10 Dimensions + 1 Augmented Column).”

```sql
CREATE TABLE decamatrix_transforms (
    id              BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    node_id         TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES ten_d_nodes(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,

    -- 11x11 matrix flattened row-major
    matrix          DOUBLE PRECISION[] NOT NULL
        CHECK (cardinality(matrix) = 121),

    proc_ref        TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PROC-041'
);
```

**Convention:**

- `matrix[ (row*11) + col + 1 ]` with `row, col ∈ [0..10]`.  
- Identity = `matrix = ARRAY[1,0,0,...]` with ones on diagonal positions.

