### 5. Metadata preservation (collapsed dimensions)

> “Store those hidden values in a ‘Metadata’ folder so they can be seen on hover.”  

```sql
CREATE TABLE metadata_cache (
    id              BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    node_id         TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES ten_d_nodes(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,

    invisible_dims  TEXT[] NOT NULL
        CHECK (invisible_dims <@ ARRAY['x','y','z','w','v','u','q','p','s','f']),
    full_vector     DOUBLE PRECISION[] NOT NULL
        CHECK (cardinality(full_vector) = 10),

    proc_ref        TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PROC-046'
);

CREATE UNIQUE INDEX metadata_cache_unique ON metadata_cache (node_id);
```

This mirrors the hover-state logic:

> “Displays the full 10D vector when hovering over a projected point.”

